WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.130
- [Narrator] As your users change roles,

2
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.080
they may need features
that aren't available

3
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.850
in their current subscription.

4
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.430
When this happens, you
can add a new subscription

5
00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.230
that includes those features

6
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:16.560
and assign licenses to
the people who need them.

7
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.723
Let's take a look at that process now.

8
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.590
First, to add the new subscription,

9
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:27.000
go to the Microsoft 365
Admin Center Simplified view,

10
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.043
select the Subscriptions tab,

11
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:34.683
add more products, then
the All Products tab.

12
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.150
Choose the Microsoft 365 category,

13
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:42.210
scroll to locate the
subscription you want to add,

14
00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:44.163
then select details.

15
00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:47.343
Next, choose the plan you want to buy,

16
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.053
the number of licenses,
the subscription length,

17
00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.530
and the billing frequency you prefer.

18
00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.733
Select buy.

19
00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:03.873
Review the checkout information,
then select place order.

20
00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:07.320
The new subscription has
been added to your account,

21
00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:08.793
and you can close the window.

22
00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:13.053
To assign the new license
to a user, select home,

23
00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.603
go to the Users tab,

24
00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:19.473
select the user that you want
to assign the license to,

25
00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.863
and then go to the Licenses and Apps tab.

26
00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:27.300
Under licenses, you'll
see your new subscription.

27
00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.330
Remove the old subscription from the user.

28
00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:33.663
Assign the new one, save changes,

29
00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:36.273
and close the window.

30
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.780
The license for the new subscription

31
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:42.330
is now assigned to the user.

32
00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:46.800
To view all of your licenses,
go to the Subscriptions tab.

33
00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:49.380
The license you just
unassigned from your user

34
00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:52.530
is now available and can
be assigned to another user

35
00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:55.083
or removed from the original subscription.
